"\n"
"These voters will need to opt back in before they can be added to elections.\n"
"They can opt back in at: %(optin_url)s\n"
"\n"
"--\n"
"Helios"
msgstr[0] ""
"\n"
"Esta persoa terá que volver darse de alta nos correos antes de poder ser engadida a eleccións.\n"
"Pode facelo en: %(optin_url)s\n"
"\n"
"--\n"
"Helios"
msgstr[1] ""
"\n"
"Estas persoas terán que volver darse de alta nos correos antes de poder ser engadidas a eleccións.\n"
"Poden facelo en: %(optin_url)s\n"
"\n"
"--\n"
"Helios"

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_docast.html:20
#, python-format
msgid "You are logged in as <u>%(voter_html)s</u>"
msgstr "Iniciaches sesión como <u>%(voter_html)s</u>"

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_docast.html:24
msgid "CAST this ballot"
msgstr "EMITIR esta papeleta"

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_docast.html:25
msgid "You can cast as many ballots as you want.<br />Only the last one counts."
msgstr "Podes emitir tantas papeletas como queiras.<br />Só contará a última."

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_docast.html:31
msgid "Are you sure you want to clear this ballot and NOT cast it?"
msgstr "Tes a certeza de que queres borrar esta papeleta e NON emitila?"

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_docast.html:32
msgid "cancel"
msgstr "cancelar"

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_docast.html:33
msgid "If you cancel now, your ballot will <em>NOT</em> be recorded."
msgstr "Se cancelas agora, a túa papeleta <em>NON</em> quedará rexistrada."

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_docast.html:34
msgid "You can start the voting process over again, of course."
msgstr "Podes volver iniciar o proceso de votación."

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_docast.html:43
msgid "voting has stopped, sorry."
msgstr "a votación rematou."

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_docast.html:48
msgid "voting has not yet begun, sorry."
msgstr "a votación aínda non comezou."

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_password.html:11
msgid "bad voter ID or password, please try again."
msgstr "ID de votante ou contrasinal incorrectos; téntao de novo."

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_password.html:15
msgid "authenticate &amp; cast ballot"
msgstr "identificarse e emitir a papeleta"

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_password.html:17
msgid "Your voter ID and password can be found in the email you received."
msgstr "O teu ID de votante e o contrasinal están no correo electrónico que recibiches."

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_password.html:18
msgid "Forgot your password? Click here to resend it."
msgstr "Esqueciches o contrasinal? Preme aquí para volver envialo."

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_password.html:19
#, python-format
msgid "If you still cannot find your login information, contact your election administrator at <tt>%(help_email)s</tt>."
msgstr "Se aínda non atopas os teus datos de acceso, contacta coa administración da elección en <tt>%(help_email)s</tt>."

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_password.html:24
msgid "Cast as many ballots as you wish: only the last one counts."
msgstr "Emite tantas papeletas como queiras: só contará a última."

#: helios/templates/_castconfirm_password.html:27 server_ui/templates/base.html:110
msgid "log in"
msgstr "iniciar sesión"

#: helios/templates/cast_done.html:3 helios/templates/election_cast_confirm.html:3 server_ui/templates/confirm.html:3
#: server_ui/templates/done.html:3
msgid "Confirm Vote"
msgstr "Confirmar o voto"

#: helios/templates/cast_done.html:6
#, python-format
msgid "%(election_name)s &mdash; Vote Successfully Cast!"
msgstr "%(election_name)s &mdash; Voto emitido correctamente!"

#: helios/templates/cast_done.html:10 helios/templates/election_cast_confirm.html:47
msgid "Your ballot tracker is:"
msgstr "O código de seguimento da túa papeleta é:"

#: helios/templates/cast_done.html:15
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This ballot tracker mathematically ensures that your ballot is counted. You can check all ballot trackers by viewing "
"the <a href=\"%(voter_list_url)s\">voter list</a>, where your ballot tracker should appear within a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Este código de seguimento garante matematicamente que a túa papeleta se contabiliza. Podes consultar todos os códigos"
" de seguimento na <a href=\"%(voter_list_url)s\">lista de votantes</a>, onde o teu debería aparecer nuns minutos."

#: helios/templates/cast_done.html:22
msgid "For your safety, we have logged you out."
msgstr "Pola túa seguridade, pechamos a túa sesión."

#: helios/templates/cast_done.html:28
msgid "return to election info"
msgstr "volver á información da elección"

#: helios/templates/castvote.html:6
#, python-format
msgid "Cast Vote %(vote_id)s"
msgstr "Voto emitido %(vote_id)s"

#: helios/templates/castvote.html:8
#, python-format
msgid "cast in <a href=\"%(election_view_url)s\">%(election_name)s</a>"
msgstr "emitido en <a href=\"%(election_view_url)s\">%(election_name)s</a>"

#: helios/templates/castvote.html:9
#, python-format
msgid "Fingerprint: <tt>%(vote_hash)s</tt>"
msgstr "Pegada dixital: <tt>%(vote_hash)s</tt>"

#: helios/templates/castvote.html:11
#, python-format
msgid "by <b><u>%(voter_display_name)s</u></b>"
msgstr "por <b><u>%(voter_display_name)s</u></b>"

#: helios/templates/castvote.html:13
msgid "details"
msgstr "detalles"

#: helios/templates/election_cast_confirm.html:6
msgid "You have not yet cast your ballot! Make sure to complete the voting process if you want your vote to count."
msgstr "Aínda non emitiches a túa papeleta! Asegúrate de completar o proceso de votación se queres que o teu voto conte."

#: helios/templates/election_cast_confirm.html:39
msgid "Don't go yet!<br />Your ballot has not yet been cast."
msgstr "Non marches aínda!<br />A túa papeleta aínda non foi emitida."

#: helios/templates/election_cast_confirm.html:42 server_ui/templates/confirm.html:51
msgid "Verifying and Casting your ballot"
msgstr "Verificando e emitindo a túa papeleta"

#: helios/templates/election_cast_confirm.html:68
msgid "Sorry!"
msgstr "Sentímolo!"

#: helios/templates/election_cast_confirm.html:71
msgid "Sorry, you are <em><u>not eligible</u></em> for this election."
msgstr "Sentímolo, <em><u>non cumpres os requisitos</u></em> para participar nesta elección."

#: helios/templates/election_cast_confirm.html:73
msgid "Sorry, you are <em>not registered</em> for this election, and registration is closed."
msgstr "Sentímolo, <em>non estás rexistrado/a</em> nesta elección e o rexistro está pechado."

#: helios/templates/election_cast_confirm.html:77
msgid "return to the main election page"
msgstr "volver á páxina principal da elección"

#: helios/templates/election_cast_confirm.html:85
msgid "This election is open to <em>anyone</em>, so log in with your preferred account."
msgstr "Esta elección está aberta a <em>calquera persoa</em>; inicia sesión coa conta que prefiras."

#: helios/templates/election_cast_confirm.html:89
msgid "This election is only open to <em>registered voters</em>, so log in with the same account you registered with."
msgstr "Esta elección está aberta só a <em>votantes rexistrados</em>; inicia sesión coa mesma conta coa que te rexistraches."

#: helios/templates/election_cast_confirm.html:98
msgid "Don't worry, we'll remember your ballot while you log in."
msgstr "Non te preocupes: gardaremos a túa papeleta mentres inicias sesión."

#: helios/templates/election_compute_tally.html:31
msgid "OK, tally has begun."
msgstr "De acordo, comezou o escrutinio."

#: helios/templates/election_new_2.html:5
msgid ""
"Have you made sure to copy the private key to a safe place?\n"
"\n"
"Once you click OK, Helios will not be able to recover the secret key without your help!"
msgstr ""
"Asegurácheste de copiar a chave privada nun lugar seguro?\n"
"\n"
"Unha vez que premas Aceptar, Helios non poderá recuperar a chave secreta sen a túa axuda!"

#: helios/templates/election_not_started.html:7
#, python-format
msgid "Election %(election_name)s Not Yet Open"
msgstr "A elección %(election_name)s aínda non está aberta"

#: helios/templates/election_not_started.html:10
msgid "This election is not yet open."
msgstr "Esta elección aínda non está aberta."

#: helios/templates/election_not_started.html:14 helios/templates/election_tallied.html:14
#: helios/templates/election_view.html:77
#, python-format
msgid "Voting starts at %(start_time)s"
msgstr "A votación comeza o %(start_time)s"

#: helios/templates/election_not_started.html:15 helios/templates/election_tallied.html:15
#: helios/templates/election_view.html:78
#, python-format
msgid "Voting ends at %(end_time)s"
msgstr "A votación remata o %(end_time)s"

#: helios/templates/election_not_started.html:19
msgid "back to the election"
msgstr "volver á elección"

#: helios/templates/election_questions.html:8
msgid "The questions could not be saved. Please check that the URLs you entered are either http:// or https://"
msgstr "Non se puideron gardar as preguntas. Comproba que os URL introducidos comezan por http:// ou https://"

#: helios/templates/election_questions.html:9
msgid "Please enter at least one answer option."
msgstr "Introduce polo menos unha opción de resposta."

#: helios/templates/election_questions.html:10
msgid "+ Add link"
msgstr "+ Engadir ligazón"

#: helios/templates/election_questions.html:11
msgid "- Hide link"
msgstr "- Agochar ligazón"

#: helios/templates/election_questions.html:12
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Please fill in all answer fields up to answer #{last}. You cannot skip answer #{skipped}."
msgstr "Cubre todos os campos de resposta ata a resposta n.º {last}. Non podes omitir a resposta n.º {skipped}."

#: helios/templates/election_register.html:5
#, python-format
msgid "%(election_name)s – Register"
msgstr "%(election_name)s – Rexistro"

#: helios/templates/election_register.html:9
#, python-format
msgid "You are currently logged in as %(user_id)s [%(user_type)s]"
msgstr "Tes a sesión iniciada como %(user_id)s [%(user_type)s]"

#: helios/templates/election_register.html:13
msgid "You are currently registered for this election."
msgstr "Xa estás rexistrado/a nesta elección."

#: helios/templates/election_register.html:17
msgid "You are <em>not</em> registered for this election."
msgstr "<em>Non</em> estás rexistrado/a nesta elección."

#: helios/templates/election_register.html:21
msgid "register!"
msgstr "rexistrarse!"

#: helios/templates/election_tallied.html:7 server_ui/templates/election_tallied.html:6
#, python-format
msgid "Election %(election_name)s Already Tallied"
msgstr "Elección %(election_name)s xa escrutada"

#: helios/templates/election_tallied.html:10
msgid "This election has already been tallied, you can no longer cast a vote."
msgstr "Esta elección xa foi escrutada; xa non podes emitir un voto."

#: helios/templates/election_tallied.html:19
