msgstr "esta %(election_type)s está destacada na páxina principal."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:52
msgid "unfeature it"
msgstr "deixar de destacala"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:55
#, python-format
msgid "this %(election_type)s is <u>not</u> featured on the front page."
msgstr "esta %(election_type)s <u>non</u> está destacada na páxina principal."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:57
msgid "feature it"
msgstr "destacala"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:76
#, python-format
msgid "Help Email Address: %(help_email)s"
msgstr "Enderezo de correo de axuda: %(help_email)s"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:82
msgid "download candidate bios &amp; statements"
msgstr "descargar biografías e declaracións das candidaturas"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:86
#, python-format
msgid "question (%(question_count)s)"
msgid_plural "questions (%(question_count)s)"
msgstr[0] "pregunta (%(question_count)s)"
msgstr[1] "preguntas (%(question_count)s)"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:88
msgid "voters &amp; ballots"
msgstr "votantes e papeletas"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:90
#, python-format
msgid "trustee (%(trustee_count)s)"
msgid_plural "trustees (%(trustee_count)s)"
msgstr[0] "custodio (%(trustee_count)s)"
msgstr[1] "custodios (%(trustee_count)s)"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:93
msgid "administrators"
msgstr "administradores"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:100
msgid "Embed an Election Badge"
msgstr "Inserir un distintivo da elección"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:106
msgid "adding this HTML to your site displays a thin banner with direct links to voting."
msgstr "ao engadir este HTML ao teu sitio mostrarase unha faixa estreita con ligazóns directas á votación."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:118
msgid "Next Step:"
msgstr "Seguinte paso:"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:126
msgid "freeze ballot and open election."
msgstr "conxelar a papeleta e abrir a elección."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:129
#, python-format
msgid ""
"once you do this, the election will be ready for voting and will open automatically<br />at %(start_time)s, as per "
"your settings."
msgstr ""
"unha vez feito isto, a elección quedará preparada para votar e abrirase automaticamente<br />o %(start_time)s, "
"segundo a configuración."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:133
msgid "once you do this, the election will be immediately open for voting."
msgstr "unha vez feito isto, a elección quedará aberta inmediatamente para votar."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:141
msgid "Tally computation is under way."
msgstr "O cálculo do escrutinio está en curso."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:142
msgid "Reload this page in a couple of minutes."
msgstr "Recarga esta páxina dentro duns minutos."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:144
msgid "compute encrypted tally"
msgstr "calcular o escrutinio cifrado"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:145
msgid "The encrypted votes will be combined into an encrypted tally. Once this is done,"
msgstr "Os votos cifrados combinaranse nun escrutinio cifrado. Unha vez feito isto,"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:146
msgid "trustees will be asked to provide their share of the decryption."
msgstr "pediráselles aos custodios que acheguen a súa parte do descifrado."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:151
msgid "release result"
msgstr "publicar o resultado"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:152
msgid "The result displayed below is visible only to you."
msgstr "O resultado que se mostra abaixo só é visible para ti."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:153
msgid "Once you release the result, it will be visible to everyone."
msgstr "Unha vez que publiques o resultado, será visible para todo o mundo."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:159
msgid "compute results"
msgstr "calcular os resultados"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:161
msgid "combine trustee decryptions and compute results"
msgstr "combinar os descifrados dos custodios e calcular os resultados"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:165
msgid "The result will be computed and shown to you, the administrator, only."
msgstr "O resultado calcularase e mostrarase unicamente a ti, como administrador/a."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:167
msgid "The decryption shares from the trustees will be combined and the tally computed."
msgstr "Combinaranse as partes de descifrado dos custodios e calcularase o escrutinio."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:168
msgid "Once you do this, the tally will visible to you, the administrator, only."
msgstr "Unha vez feito isto, o escrutinio será visible unicamente para ti, como administrador/a."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:171
msgid "trustees (for decryption)"
msgstr "custodios (para o descifrado)"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:192
msgid "This election is complete."
msgstr "Esta elección está completada."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:196
msgid "Tally"
msgstr "Escrutinio"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:198
#, python-format
msgid "Question #%(question_number)s"
msgstr "Pregunta n.º %(question_number)s"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:210
msgid "Election closed. Results will be released soon."
msgstr "Elección pechada. Os resultados publicaranse axiña."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:215
#, python-format
msgid "Vote in this %(election_type)s"
msgstr "Votar nesta %(election_type)s"

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:219
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This %(election_type)s was initially scheduled to end at %(original_end)s,<br />but has been extended until "
"%(extended_end)s."
msgstr ""
"Esta %(election_type)s estaba prevista inicialmente para rematar o %(original_end)s,<br />pero ampliouse ata o "
"%(extended_end)s."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:225
#, python-format
msgid "This %(election_type)s is scheduled to end at %(end_time)s."
msgstr "Esta %(election_type)s está prevista que remate o %(end_time)s."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:227
#, python-format
msgid "This %(election_type)s ends at the administrator's discretion."
msgstr "Esta %(election_type)s remata cando o decida a administración."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:234
#, python-format
msgid "This election is <em>private</em>. You are signed in as eligible voter <em>%(voter_name)s</em>."
msgstr "Esta elección é <em>privada</em>. Iniciaches sesión como votante habilitado/a <em>%(voter_name)s</em>."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:238
msgid "You do not have Java installed in your browser."
msgstr "Non tes Java instalado no navegador."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:238
msgid "At this time, Helios requires Java."
msgstr "Neste momento, Helios require Java."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:239
msgid "Visit <a target=\"_new\" href=\"http://java.sun.com\">java.sun.com</a> to install it."
msgstr "Visita <a target=\"_new\" href=\"http://java.sun.com\">java.sun.com</a> para instalalo."

#: helios/templates/election_view.html:244
