#: helios_auth/templates/perms_why.html:8
msgid ""
"It looks like you declined to grant us permission to access your information. We understand and value your privacy. "
"We ask for this information so we can contact you with your voting tracking number and when an election in which you "
"participated has been tallied. We promise not to use this information for any other purpose. Without this "
"information, we unfortunately cannot help you vote."
msgstr ""
"Parece que rexeitaches darnos permiso para acceder á túa información. Entendemos e respectamos a túa privacidade. "
"Pedimos esta información para poder contactar contigo co teu código de seguimento do voto e cando se complete o "
"escrutinio dunha elección na que participaches. Comprometémonos a non usar esta información para ningún outro fin. "
"Sen estes datos, lamentablemente non podemos axudarche a votar."

#: helios_auth/templates/perms_why.html:15
msgid "OK, I understand, let's do this login thing."
msgstr "De acordo, enténdoo; quero iniciar sesión."

#: helios_auth/templates/perms_why.html:17
